          "principleEvolved": "<p><b>Principle Evolved & Doctrinal Significance:</b> Privy Council: the section \"raises no presumption that the parties are to be governed by custom rather than by personal law which must be applied unless the custom is proved. This authority establishes foundational principles governing judicial precedent, statutory construction, and constitutional jurisprudence under the University of Delhi curriculum.</p>"
