          "id": "overseas-tankship-u-k-ltd-v-morts-dock-e-u5",
          "name": "Overseas Tankship (U.K.) Ltd. v. Morts Dock & Engineering Co.",
          "citation": "[1961] AC 388 (Wagon Mound No. 1); Wagon Mound (No. 2) [1967] 1 AC 617 Dias",
