          "examStrategy": "(1) Shayara Bano (SC 2017): Triple Talaq violates Art. 14 as manifestly arbitrary and is not an essential religious practice protected under Art. 25. (2) In wife's judicial divorce, list S. 2 DMMA 1939 grounds: failure to maintain for 2 years gives right even if wife left without justification (majority view).",
