          "anchorId": "case1",
          "facts": "✅ Example 1 — IS a White Collar Criminal",
          "issues": "❌ Example 3 — NOT a White Collar Criminal",
          "arguments": "Submissions of the respective parties before the Court in Four Illustrative Examples from 47th Report.",
