          "mnemonic": "💡 M-E-D-I-A: Medium (Print/Broadcast/Digital) • Effect Test (Bennett Coleman) • Derivative Right (19(1)(a)) • Immunity (Sec 79 IT Act) • Airwaves Public Trust (CAB).",
