          "mnemonic": "💡 D-O-U-B-L-E: Decoy vs Accomplice • Overriding Prudence • Uncorroborated Legal (S. 138) • Bhuboni Sahu Test • Lack of Co-accused Corroboration • Essential Pardon Terms.",
          "title": "Accomplice Evidence — Quick Revision Capsule",
