          "answer": "Model answer (outline). Essentials (Part 8 table): representation of authority (fraudulent/erroneous); immovable property; professed transfer for consideration; transferee misled — no notice; subsequent acquisition of interest; subsisting contract; transferee's option; no intervening BFP. State of mind: transferor's irrelevant — 1929 amendment, Jumma Masjid ; transferee's decisive — Kartar Singh (reasonable and diligent inquiry; note in deed = notice). Second paragraph: transferee for consideration, in good faith, without notice of the existence of the option — explain with s.3 notice Explanations (registration, possession) and an example. Mention English rule (automatic feeding; volunteers) for comparison and SRA s.13 for contracts.",
