          "examTips": "2014 (6) SLR 6 (SC) · 2014 AIR SCW 5515 · Civil Appeal No. 8434 of 2014 (arising out of SLP (C) No. 22487 of 2012), decided 3 September 2014 · Bench: Sudhansu Jyoti Mukhopadhaya and V. Gopala Gowda, JJ. (judgment by Gopala Gowda J.) · Proportionality as a constitutional standard"
