          "citation": "Constitution Bench · S.P. Bharucha, J. (for himself, Y.K. Sabharwal & Ruma Pal, JJ.) · quo warranto · Arts 164(1) & (4), 173, 191, 361 · RPA 1951 s. 8(3)",
          "unitNumber": 3,
