          "anchorId": "case30",
          "facts": "Holding in one line: expulsion for grave misconduct is a House privilege under Article 105(3), but the Constitution permits limited review for illegality and unconstitutionality, not appellate re-weighing of evidence or correction of mere procedural irregularity.",
