          "anchorId": "case-43",
          "facts": "Material facts from DU Case Material.",
          "issues": "Constitutional questions on judicial appointments and independence.",
          "arguments": "Submissions of Union of India and Bar Associations.",
          "ratio": "Governing ratio decidendi on the Indian higher judiciary.",
