          "htmlContent": "id=\"s11\"><span class=\"snum\">11</span><span class=\"stxt\"><small>Revision</small>The whole topic on four pages</span></h2>\n\n<p class=\"lead\">Everything above, compressed. Read §11.1 the night before the paper, §11.2 in the last hour, and §11.4 if\nyou have only ten minutes.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"s11-1\"><span class=\"tick\">◆</span>11.1 The skeleton</h3>\n\n<div class=\"svgwrap\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 900 420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Revision skeleton of the topic: charge, scope, residence, source, incidence, and the three cases mapped to their provisions\">\n<rect width=\"900\" height=\"420\" fill=\"#fffdf8\"/>\n<rect x=\"230\" y=\"8\" width=\"440\" height=\"32\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#101f3f\"/>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"29\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"12.6\" fill=\"#f7f1e1\">THE SKELETON — six boxes and three cases</text>\n\n<g font-family=\"Georgia,serif\">\n<rect x=\"25\" y=\"56\" width=\"180\" height=\"62\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#101f3f\"/>\n<text x=\"115\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f7f1e1\">s. 4</text>\n<text x=\"115\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#e8dfc8\">charge · rates ·</text>\n<text x=\"115\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#e8dfc8\">\"total income\"</text>\n\n<rect x=\"230\" y=\"56\" width=\"180\" height=\"62\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#1f3a63\"/>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f7f1e1\">s. 5</text>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#e8dfc8\">scope of total income ·</text>\n<text x=\"320\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#e8dfc8\">ROR / RNOR / NR</text>\n\n<rect x=\"435\" y=\"56\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#fdf6e3\" stroke=\"#c9a94a\"/>\n<text x=\"535\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#101f3f\">s. 6 — the person</text>\n<text x=\"535\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#33301f\">days · control &amp; management ·</text>\n<text x=\"535\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#33301f\">incorporation / POEM</text>\n\n<rect x=\"660\" y=\"56\" width=\"215\" height=\"62\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#eaf5ef\" stroke=\"#a9cbb9\"/>\n<text x=\"767\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1f5040\">s. 9 — the income</text>\n<text x=\"767\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#14402f\">business connection · property ·</text>\n<text x=\"767\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#14402f\">asset · transfer · payments</text>\n\n<path d=\"M205 87 H226\" stroke=\"#6b5a24\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n<path d=\"M410 87 H431\" stroke=\"#6b5a24\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n<path d=\"M635 87 H656\" stroke=\"#6b5a24\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n\n<rect x=\"230\" y=\"146\" width=\"440\" height=\"40\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f2ecf9\" stroke=\"#b7a4cf\"/>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"171\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11.6\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#3b2a55\">s. 6 + s. 9 → s. 5 → the incidence of tax (Table 5.1)</text>\n\n<!-- case mapping -->\n<rect x=\"25\" y=\"212\" width=\"270\" height=\"94\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#eef3fb\" stroke=\"#9db4d6\"/>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1f3a63\">CASE 11 · 1951</text>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#22334f\">HUF — s. 6(2)</text>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#22334f\">head and brain · wholly · onus</text>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#22334f\">activity ≠ residence</text>\n<text x=\"160\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1f3a63\">held: resident</text>\n\n<rect x=\"315\" y=\"212\" width=\"270\" height=\"94\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#eaf5ef\" stroke=\"#a9cbb9\"/>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1f5040\">CASE 12 · 1954</text>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#14402f\">company — s. 6(3) ancestor</text>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#14402f\">doing ≠ controlling</text>\n<text x=\"450\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10.4\" fill=\"#14402f\">seat"
